#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — et samlet astronomiprogram til planlægning, observation, billedtagning og videnskab."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmer: IAU 2006-præcession og -nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) eller analytiske efemerider efter Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nhimmellys efter Krisciunas & Schaefer, Schaefers visuelle tærskler, trekantinvariant stjernematchning med RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstakning med kappa-sigma-, winsoriseret, lineærtilpasset og generaliseret ESD-forkastelse, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy med total variation (Dey m.fl.), starlet-wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generaliseret hyperbolsk strækning,\nlucky imaging med flere punkter, sfærisk derotation af planeter, generaliseret Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, passagemodel af Mandel-Agol-typen med ensemble-MCMC."

